@startuml sequence-login
title Diagram Sekwencji: Logowanie Użytkownika

actor User
participant "Frontend\n(React)" as Frontend
participant "AuthController" as Controller
participant "AuthService" as Service
participant "UserRepository" as Repo
participant "PasswordEncoder\n(BCrypt)" as Encoder
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "JwtService" as JWT

User -> Frontend: 1. Wpisuje email i hasło
Frontend -> Controller: 2. POST /api/auth/login
Controller -> Service: 3. login(LoginRequest)
Service -> Repo: 4. findByEmail(email)
Repo -> DB: 5. SELECT * FROM users WHERE email=?
DB --> Repo: 6. User record
Repo --> Service: 7. User object

alt User znaleziony
  Service -> Encoder: 8. matches(password, passwordHash)
  Encoder --> Service: 9. boolean result
  
  alt Hasło prawidłowe
    Service -> JWT: 10. generateToken(user)
    JWT --> Service: 11. JWT token
    Service --> Controller: 12. AuthResponse(token, user)
    Controller --> Frontend: 13. 200 OK {token, user}
    Frontend -> Frontend: 14. localStorage.setItem(token)
    Frontend --> User: 15. ✅ Zalogowany\nPrzejście do panelu
  else Hasło błędne
    Service --> Controller: 10. BadCredentialsException
    Controller --> Frontend: 11. 401 Unauthorized
    Frontend --> User: 12. ❌ Nieprawidłowe hasło
  end
else User nie znaleziony
  Service --> Controller: 8. BadCredentialsException
  Controller --> Frontend: 9. 401 Unauthorized
  Frontend --> User: 10. ❌ Email nie istnieje
end

note over JWT
  Token zawiera:
  - email
  - userId
  - role
  - expiration (24h)
end note

@enduml